desc:
1 Bedroom Basement Unit in Kitsilano Character Home:

- Excellent condition;
- Air Conditioning;
- Kitchen includes new appliances: fridge, dishwasher, stove & breakfast bar;
- Bathroom has a shower & bathtub (together);
- Street parking;

Amazing Location:
- Beautiful street in a safe and quiet neighborhood in Kits;
- 2 minute walk from Broadway near Nuba & many other restaurants, the Parthenon (groceries), Shoppers Drug Mart, Starbucks and fresh fruit/veggie stores;
- 2 minute walk from West 4th Avenue
- Less than 10 minute walk to Safeway on Broadway or Fresh Street Market on West 4th Avenue;
- A few minutes walk to Point Grey Road for jogging and biking;
- Walking distance to Jericho Beach;
- Close to UBC and downtown;
- Easy access to transit with many buses stopping (and downtown) on Broadway and West 4th;

No pets, no parties, no drugs and no smoking/vaping;
1/2 month rent as damage deposit;
Available September 15th or October 1st;
$1725
Single occupancy only and one year lease preferred.

This is a great unit. If you are interested please let us know a bit about yourself and how long you are looking to rent it for.
